     "matchLevel": "none",
     "matchedWords": [],
     "value": "Share your information if you are looking for work. Please use this format:<p><pre><code>  Location:\n  Remote:\n  Willing to relocate:\n  Technologies:\n  Résumé/CV:\n  Email:\n</code></pre>\nPlease only post if you are personally looking for work. Agencies, recruiters, job boards,\nand so on, are off topic here.<p>Readers: please only email these addresses to discuss work opportunities.<p>Searchers: try <a href=\"https://nthesis.ai/public/hn-wants-to-be-hired\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://nthesis.ai/public/hn-wants-to-be-hired</a>, <a href=\"https://www.wantstobehired.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.wantstobehired.com</a>."
